e for 555-123-2002. Roaming is already enabled on it. I'll check its plan next.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":10,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:30.813434","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"id":"P1002"},"id":"toolu_01HWoyVL2PNaz5Q9Q9wNtNAR","name":"get_details_by_id","requestor":"evaluated_agent"},{"arguments":{"customer_id":"C1001","line_id":"L1002"},"id":"toolu_01MJ1yQ2zp5mRUK3aD7oieqf","name":"get_data_usage","requestor":"evaluated_agent"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":10,"usage":{"completion_tokens":170,"prompt_tokens":12290}},{"content":"{\"plan_id\": \"P1002\", \"name\": \"Premium Plan\", \"data_limit_gb\": 15.0, \"price_per_month\": 65.0, \"data_refueling_price_per_gb\": 2.0}","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"evaluated_agent","role":"tool","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:30.813675","tool_call_id":"toolu_01HWoyVL2PNaz5Q9Q9wNtNAR","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":11,"usage":null},{"content":"{\"line_id\": \"L1002\", \"data_used_gb\": \"15.1\", \"data_limit_gb\": \"15.0\", \"data_refueling_gb\": \"0.0\", \"cycle_end_date\": \"2025-02-28\"}","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"evaluated_agent","role":"tool","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:30.813725","tool_call_id":"toolu_01MJ1yQ2zp5mRUK3aD7oieqf","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":12,"usage":null},{"content":"Thank you, John. I found the likely cause. Your line (555-123-2002) is on the Premium Plan, which has a 15 GB monthly data limit. You've used 15.1 GB this cycle, which ends on 2025-02-28. Going over the limit cuts off data connectivity. Roaming is already enabled on your line.\n\nYou have two options:\n1. **Refuel data.** It costs $2.00 per GB, and you can add up to 2 GB.\n2. **Change to a plan with more data.** I can list the available plans for you.\n\nWhich would you like? If you want to refuel, tell me how many GB.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:34.061803","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":313,"prompt_tokens":12662}},{"content":"I don't want to change my plan. I would like to refuel 2.0 GB of data, please. Can you do that for me?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:35.962641","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":53,"prompt_tokens":2762}},{"content":"Refueling 2.0 GB at $2.00 per GB comes to **$4.00**. The charge will be added to your bill for line 555-123-2002.\n\nDo you want me to go ahead? (yes/no)","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:39.038169","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":220,"prompt_tokens":12901}},{"content":"Yes, please go ahead and refuel the 2.0 GB of data for me. Thank you.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:40.096396","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":24,"prompt_tokens":2819}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:46:41.270460","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"customer_id":"C1001","gb_amount":2.0,"line_id":